VF-ABT006: abort condition not covered by abort contract
Phase: semantic
Location: line 9, column 9
Found: abort NotFound
Expected: path implies aborts NotFound condition
Hint:
A conditional abort contract only covers abort sites reached under the same condition.

Move the `abort ErrorName` under a matching `if` guard, change the `aborts ErrorName when ...` condition, or remove the condition if every path may abort with that error.
